asala_Pouch_3D.png',120.00,100.00,10,1,4,'null','Unyk Chicken Masala is a mix of aromatic and flavorful spices which adds a unique earthy flavor to your dishes.\r\n\r\nIt\'s the most magical and extraordinary mix of spices that is used mostly in Indian cuisine.\r\n\r\nThis masala pairs perfectly with the chicken making it delightful.','Masala'),(62,'UNYK CHOLE MASALA 100 GM V2','UNYK CHOLE MASALA 100 GM V2','products/PRDPRDPRDPRDPRD_11111_2212025145722_PRD_10_40202511940_Chhole_Masala_Pouch_3D.png',100.00,80.00,10,1,4,'null','Chole Masala is the most excellent ingredient to make spicy, delicious and tasty chole masala.\r\n\r\nA perfect blend of spices and others so evenly balanced that it not only adds taste but also enhances the flavour and also imparts really natural\r\ntaste of chhole / Chana.','Masala'),(63,'UNYK CHOLE MASALA 100 GM V3','UNYK CHOLE MASALA 100 GM V3','products/PRDPRDPRDPRDPRD_11111_2212025145722_PRD_10_40202511940_Chhole_Masala_Pouch_3D_JLkudyj.png',120.00,100.00,10,1,4,'null','Chole Masala is the most excellent ingredient to make spicy, delicious and tasty chole masala.\r\n\r\nA perfect blend of spices and others so evenly balanced that it not only adds taste but also enhances the flavour and also imparts really natural\r\ntaste of chhole / Chana.','Masala'),(64,'UNYK BIRYANI MASALA 100 GM V2','UNYK BIRYANI MASALA 100 GM V2','products/PRD_10_40202510532_Biryani_Masala_Pouch_3D.png',150.00,120.00,10,1,4,'null','Biryani is a authentic dish, very famous in all communities.\r\n\r\nUnyk biryani masala is ready-to-add mix that gives you lip-smacking veg and non-veg biryani.\r\n\r\nIt\'s made from a blend of special spices that ensures you get a delectable taste in every spoon.\r\n\r\nRelish on Royal cuisine with this Biryani Masala.','Masala'),(65,'UNYK FISH FRY MASALA 100 GM V2','UNYK FISH FRY MASALA 100 GM V2','products/PRD_10_40202511150_Fish_Fry_Masala_Pouch_3D.png',120.00,100.00,10,1,4,'null','Seafood lovers have nothing to worry as Unky Fish fry