ralysis) & nerve injury. Helps in facial palsy.\r\n\r\nRegulates blood supply in affected areas, overcomes anoxia & stimulates cerebro neural activity. Provides nutrition support to nerves &\r\nblood vessels.\r\n\r\nUseful in osteoarthritis and rheumatoid arthritis.','Uniaktiv'),(83,'UNIAKTIV Kidney 60 Cap V2','UNIAKTIV Kidney\r\n\r\nVarun | Yava | Kanchnar | Mooli Leaves','products/Kidney.png',1400.00,1200.00,10,1,3,'DOSE: 1 Capsule 2 - 3 times a day.','BENEFITS\r\n\r\nRegulate kidney functions and strengthens kidney.\r\n\r\nWorks on reducing symptoms of kidney disease like swelling, burning micturition etc.\r\n\r\nHas lithotripsic action & helps to remove kidney stones.\r\n\r\nHelps to normalize kidney function tests parameters so that kidney can work smoothly.','Uniaktiv'),(84,'UNIAKTIV Liver 60 Cap V2','Tapyadi Loha | Navayas Loha | Arogyavardhini Ras | Kutki | Kalmegh | Amlatas |\r\nRevandchini | Punarnava | Rohitak | Sharpunkha | Maakoy | Chirayita | Bhuiamla: |\r\nLecithin','products/_Liver_nbwzsCz.png',1400.00,1200.00,10,1,3,'DOSE: 1 Capsules 2 - 3 times a day.','BENEFITS:\r\n\r\nSupports normal liver functions like digestion, detoxification.\r\n\r\nHelps in formation and normalizing of liver enzymes.\r\n\r\nEffectively promotes health of spleen and gall bladder as well.\r\n\r\nHas effective anti-viral effect and protects from hepatitis and helps liver cells in regeneration.','Uniaktiv'),(85,'UNIAKTIV D-Stress 30 V2','Stress Is The Body\'s Response To Pressure, Unusual Circumstances And Events That\r\nHappen To Us. It Happens In Different Situations But Too Much Stress Is Harmful To Our\r\nHealth. If You Will Not Manage It Earlier It Leads To Depressive Disorders Which Are\r\nSilent Killers Of Happiness.\r\n\r\nAlso Causes High Blood Pressure, Weight Gain, Loss Of Fucus, Digestive Problems &\r\nHeart Diseases.','products/PRD_10_20202514392_D-Stress.png',800.00,600.00,10,1,3,'null','Details\r\n\r\n7 Tips to reduce stress\r\n\r\n- Use Unilink new formula of happiness D-STRESS\r\n\r\n- Exercise 30/40 min daily\r\n\r\n- Reduce intake of alcohol, drugs & caffeine\r\n\r\nTime & priority task management\r\n\r\n- Breathing & meditation\r\n\r\n- A cute smile everyday\r\n\r\n- Take one chat shot with friends','Uniaktiv'),(86,'UNIAKTIV CMD 60 ml','CMD Is A Highly Concentrated Mineral And Trace Mineral Product, About 50 Times\r\nMore Concentrated Than Sea Water. The Mineral In CMD Are In lonic Form Making\r\nThem Highly Bioavailable.\r\n\r\nThis Product Is Carefully Crafted Through A Traditional, All-Natural, Solar-\r\nConcentration Process That Does Not Use Any Artificial Ingredients, Artificial Drying\r\nProcesses, Or Minerals Sourced From Facilities Other Than Those Controlled By The\r\nAnderson Family.','products/PRD_1_212022154123_Uniaktiv_CMD.png',1800.00,16650.00,10,1,3,'How to use:\r\nCMD is very simple to use and below are few of the ways you can use CMD. Just add 20 to 30 drops to any of your drink during your day and it\r\nwill provide you sufficient mineral supplement.\r\nYou may also use CMD in cooking of your food, it will not only increase flavor of your food but will also enrich its nutrition value.','CMD is a highly concentrated mineral and trace mineral product, about 50 times more concentrated than sea water. The mineral in CMD are in\r\nionic form making them highly bioavailable.\r\nThis product is carefully crafted through a traditional, all-natural, solar-concentration process that does not use any artificial ingredients, artificial\r\ndrying processes, or minerals sourced from facilities other than those controlled by the Anderson family.\r\n\r\nBenefits\r\n\r\n1) IONIC: CMD is made up of naturally - ionized minerals, which are very important to our bodies in two ways :-\r\n\r\n(a) First, we cannot benefit from minerals unless we can absorb them. Minerals transfer into the blood stream through the walls of the small\r\nintestines only if they are ionically charged. CMD contains naturally - ionized mineral, which can be fully absorbed.\r\n(b) Second, ions take part in biochemical processes throughout the body. These processes help nutrients move to those areas of the body that\r\nare in most need of their help.\r\n2) PURE: CMD is extracted from the northern part of the Great Salt Lake, Utah, USA.\r\nThe water in this part of the lake is twice as concentrated as that in the southern arm. It is quite far away from human habitation and their\r\npolluting activities.\r\n\r\n3) NATURAL: CMD is not a laboratory product. It is lake water with 99.5% sodium removed. It is 100% natural. No artificial coloring,\r\npreservative or flavoring is added.\r\n\r\n4) CONCENTRATED: CMD is 50 times more concentrated than sea water. It is more concentrated than any other mineral supplement in the\r\nmarket.\r\n\r\n5) COMPLETE: CMD comprises of macro minerals (magnesium, calcium, potassium, chloride and sulfur) and over 40 micro minerals like\r\nchromium, iodine, manganese, selenium & zinc, making it a most complete mineral supplement.\r\n\r\n6) MULTI FUNCTIONAL: It has got multi-functional properties, for example, It can improve our health :-\r\n\r\na. Giving a boost to the body\'s immune system\r\nb. Facilitating the transmission of micro-electrical impulses in our nervous system\r\nc. Acting as catalyst in the formation of new blood cells\r\nd. Increasing the body\'s metabolism\r\ne. Strengthening the structure of our bodies by giving us stronger teeth, bones, nails etc\r\n\r\n7) BALANCED: CMD is not only complete but also balanced. If the minerals in our body are balanced, they work together to create a dynamic\r\nequilibrium. Some supplements, which focus on one or few minerals, can lower the level of other minerals in the body and can cause over\r\nconsumption and toxicity\r\n\r\n8) CONVENIENT: It is easy to consume, just add 20-40 drops to your drinks or food per day for adults\r\n\r\n9) PROVEN: Millions of testimonies across the world prove that CMD is vital for human health\r\n\r\n10) ECONOMICAL: CMD is affordable compared to other mineral supplement available in the market','Uniaktiv'),(87,'UNIAKTIV ASTA - REVIT 60 CAP V2','Uniaktiv Asta-Revit 60 Capsule','products/PRD_10_20202515151_Asta-Revit.png',2500.00,2000.00,10,1,3,'null','Uniaktiv Asta-Revit 60 Capsule','Uniaktiv'),(88,'Tulsi Drops 30 ml','Tulsi Drops Is An Ayurvedic Proprietary Medicine. A Blend Of Five Types Of Tulsi Leaf\r\nExtract Mixed In Perfect Proportion.','products/PRD_1_2411202117220_Tulsi_Drops_30_ml.png',300.00,250.00,10,1,3,'DOSAGE: Daily recommended dosages.\r\n\r\n5-10 drops (0.15 to 0.3ml) 2-3 times a day in water (lukewarm) or tea or as directed by a physician.','Tulsi Drops is An Ayurvedic Proprietary Medicine. A blend of five types of Tulsi leaf extract mixed in perfect proportion.The five types of Tulsi are\r\n\r\no Babui Tulsi (Ocimum Basilicum)\r\no Drudriha Tulsi (Ocimum Album)\r\no Ram Tulsi (Ocimum Gratissimum)\r\no Shyam Tulsi (Ocimum Sanctum)\r\no Vana Tulsi (Ocimum Tenuiflorum)\r\nTULSI BENEFITS ACCORDING TO AYURVEDA\r\no Helps to Boosts Immunity power.\r\no Possess Antioxidant properties\r\no Has more in Antimicrobial properties\r\no Tulsi is known as one of the Adaptogen\r\no Helps to Purify Blood\r\no Acts as Appetizer & Improves digestion\r\no Good for skin health\r\no Relieves from cough & cold & other respiratory diseases\r\no Considered good for Joint Health as it\r\no Good for Heart & liver health\r\nSTORAGE INSTRUCTION:\r\n\r\no Store in a cool & dry place. Protected from direct sunlight & sources of heat.\r\no Do not freeze.\r\no Re-cap tightly after every use.\r\nUSAGE DIRECTION:','Nutrimark'),(89,'Nutrimark Aci Plus 200ml','Nutrimark AciPlus Is An Ayurvedic Solution For Symptoms Such As Indigestion,\r\nFlatulence, Heartburns, Acidity, Regurgitation Of Food Bloating Of The Abdomen,\r\nAbdominal Cramps And Pains Related To Digestion, Etc. It Is A Mild And Safe Herbal\r\nAid To Digestion And An Appetizer.','products/PRDPRDPRDPRDPRD_4242424242_80202515827_Aci_Plus_-_1000x1000.png',250.00,220.00,10,1,3,'Caution:\r\nShake well before use. Close the bottle tightly. Keep in a cool and dry place.','Mukta Shukti Bhasma & Kapardika Bhasam:\r\n\r\nMuktashukti Bhasma is a time-tested remedy for acidity, Prevents colic problems. Muktashukti Bhasma gives quick and effective relief from\r\nacidity enhances Digestion\r\n\r\nSoothshekhar:\r\n\r\nSootshekhar Rasa is an important medicine used in ayurveda, which acts on PITTA DOSHA and reduces symptoms like heartburn, nausea,\r\nvomiting, abdominal pain, epigastric tenderness etc.\r\n\r\nJaharmohra Pishti & Yashad Bhasam:\r\n\r\nJahar Mohra Pishti is an ayurvedic mineral-based formulation. It acts on pitta related disorders, heart burn, headache and gastro enteritis.\r\n\r\nDugdhapashana & Shankh Bhasma:\r\n\r\nThese brings relief from chronic indigestion problems. Shankha Bhasma is a time-tested medication that soothes your stomach, heals the\r\ndamages from contaminations and boosts your digestion.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS:\r\n\r\n1.Has wonderful Antacid, Anti-diarrheal & Antispasmodic activity.\r\n\r\n2.Work as Appetite stimulant and Digestive.\r\n\r\n3.Useful in Hyper Acidity, Gastritis & Ulcers.\r\n\r\nDirection For Use :\r\n\r\nGastritis - 1tsp, three times a day (morning, afternoon, night) 1 hour before meals.','Nutrimark'),(90,'Nutrimark Bio-Calmag-D 60 Tablet','Not Only Your Bones & Teeth Need Calcium, Your Body Uses It For A Lot Of Different\r\nThings Like Critical Metabolic Functions As Cardiovascular Function, Muscle Function,\r\nNerve Transmission, Intracellular Signaling & Hormone Secretion','products/Bio-CalMag_D_3D_-_1000x1000.png',500.00,400.00,10,1,3,'SUGGESTED USE:\r\n\r\nTake one tablet, two- three times daily with meals','Not only your bones & teeth need calcium, your body uses it for a lot of different things like critical metabolic functions as cardiovascular\r\nfunction, muscle function, nerve transmission, intracellular signalling & hormone secretion. Calcium a