e and consequent health problems. One of the vital nutritional elements that the human body requires is Omega 3 fatty acid\r\nthat is usually found in abundance in non-vegetarian foods. However, only a few vegetarian food sources contain this essential fatty acid. Of\r\nthese, flax seed is rich in Omega 3 alpha-linolenic acid. Flax seed is also rich in lignans and mucilage.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS:\r\n\r\no Omega 3 (ALA) protects heart and reduces blood vessel damage due to inflammations for good heart health.\r\no Polyphenols and lignans serve as powerful antioxidants and reduce oxidative damage.\r\no Lignans are known to support hormonal imbalance in Post Menopausal women.\r\no Helps to reduces bad cholesterol in the body and helps in weight loss.\r\no Omega 3 also helps in reducing high blood pressure.\r\no Helps to improve digestion and improves absorption of nutrients.\r\no Beneficial for post menopausal women and reduces symptoms as well as risk of osteoporosis. Menstruating women can keep the cycles\r\nregular with regular consumption of flaxseed oil.\r\no Useful for healthier hair, skin and nails.','Nutrimark'),(94,'UNIAKTIV Detox 30 Cap V2','UniAktiv Detox Is Wonderful And Effective Product Which Helps Body Detoxify And\r\nStrengthen Your Stomach And Digestion.','products/PRD_10_20202515715_Detox.png',700.00,600.00,10,1,3,'DOSE: 1 Capsules 2 - 3 times a day.','BENEFITS\r\n\r\n- Removes toxins & achieve complete detoxification. Reduces symptoms of acidity, indigestion, anorexia, constipation etc.\r\n\r\n- Improves digestion by production of digestive enzymes.\r\n\r\n- Improves gut health and recurrence of digestive issues.','Uniaktiv'),(95,'Nutrimark Uri Plus 200ml','Kidneys Are Essential Parts Of Our Body And Are Responsible For Impurities Kidney\r\nDisease Can Affect The Body\'s Ability To Clean The Blood, Filter The Extra Water From\r\nThe Body, Etc. Whether It Is A Kidney Stone Or A Kidney Infection. UriPlus Is An\r\nExcellent Solution For Kidney Disease.','products/PRD_42_80202515728_Uri_Plus_-_1000x1000.png',250.00,220.00,10,1,3,'Directions For Use:\r\n\r\n1tsp, three times a day (morning, afternoon, night) 1 hour before meals.\r\n\r\nSafety Information:\r\n\r\nStore in a cool and dry place away from sunlight\r\n\r\nKeep out of the reach of children\r\n\r\nStop using this product if you feel dizziness, stomach ache, rashes, or severe vomiting','Yavakshara:\r\n\r\nBecause of alkaline it nature it generates more urine to flush out all harmful substances from your kidneys and reduces their workload.\r\nYavakshara is an Ayurvedic medicine that is used for treating urinary diseases, bloating, abdominal pain & calculus.\r\n\r\nPashanbhed & Kulathi:\r\n\r\nIt prevents the formation of calculi and also helps in the easy expulsion of existing stones via urine by increasing urine production.\r\n\r\nGokhru & Varun:\r\n\r\nIt has diuretic, lithotriptic, anti-inflammatory and pain-relieving action. It cuts stones into tiny bits and then flushes them out. It offers relief from\r\nthe symptoms of fluid overload, dysuria, hematuria and heat.\r\n\r\nTrinpanchmool & Punarnava:\r\n\r\nIt is also a good blood purifier that helps to maintain homeostasis. Jeeraka contains a fair amount of phosphorus, which is a vital nutrient for\r\nproper kidney function. Helpful in UTI infection as well.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS:\r\n\r\n1. Supports and enhances the kidney\r\n\r\n2. It helps in function and blood glucose levels in the body.\r\n\r\n3. It helps to treat kidney, bladder, urinary tract disease.\r\n\r\n4. It helps to cure kidney stones and kidney-related problems.\r\n\r\n5. It helps to manage pain and inflammation.','Nutrimark'),(96,'Nutrimark Haem Plus 200ml','Iron Is An Essential Element For Blood Production. About 70 Percent Of Your Body\'s Iron\r\nIs Found In The Red Blood Cells Of Your Blood Called Hemoglobin And In Muscle Cells\r\nCalled Myoglobin. Hemoglobin Is Essential For Transferring Oxygen In Your Blood From\r\nThe Lungs To The Tissues.','prod