 and gives your skin a deep cleansing. This also helps to control\r\nthe oil secretion in your skin, making it perfect for skin prone to blackheads and acne','Oceanfresh'),(98,'Ocean fresh antiageing cream V1','Ocean Fresh Anti Ageing Cream','products/PRD_1_1842024103530_Anti_Ageing_Cream_50g-New_-_1000X1000.png',400.00,300.00,10,1,2,'null','With ocean fresh antiageing cream reverse signs of aging and reduce wrinkles and fine lines with this lightweight and quick-absorbing cream.\r\ninfused with the goodness of almond oil, argan oil, avocado oil which has power of Collagen, this cream helps to boosts skin\'s elasticity and\r\nkeeps it firm. Due to skin tightening benefits of Dead Sea Minerals also helps to rejuvenates dry skin, while Collagen reduces wrinkles and fine\r\nlines, So enjoy your youth again with this unique Oceanfresh Antiageing Cream','Oceanfresh'),(99,'Ocean Fresh-Anti Dandruff Shampoo 500ml','Ocean Fresh Anti Dandruff Shampoo Provides Technologically Advanced Shampoo\r\nWhich Targets Root Cause Of Problem And Removes Stubborn Dandruff And\r\nUnderlying Problems To Provide Healthy Shiny And Lustrous Hairs.','products/PRD_1_304202218436_OceanFresh_Anti-Dandruff_Shampoo_500_ml_1000x1000px.png',500.00,400.00,10,1,2,'null','Dandruff is now a days main problem which occurs due to excess sweating, poor hygine which eventually leads to itchy scalp, flakes and severe\r\nhairfall. Oceanfresh Anti Dandruff Shampoo provides technologically advanced shampoo which targets root cause of problem & removes\r\nstubborn Dandruff & underlying problems to provide healthy shiny and lustrous hairs.','Oceanfresh'),(100,'Ocean Fresh Under Eye Gel 20ml','Ocean Fresh Under Eye Gel 20ml','products/PRD_10_2742022113330_Under_Eye_Gel_20ml_1000x1000px.png',300.00,200.00,10,1,2,'null','Eyes are considered to be epitome of once beauty. But excess exposure to mobiles, TV, low nutrition rich foods and late night lifestyle along with\r\nstress has accelerated sign of ageing like puffiness, sagging of skin and hyper pigmentation around eyes making it difficult to have beautiful and\r\nconfident eyes which one can be proud off.','Oceanfresh'),(101,'Ocean Fresh Sun Screen','Ocean Fresh Presents Unique Sunscreen With SPF 60 Benefit To Address The Side\r\nEffects Of Tropical Temperature.','products/PRD_10_2312024172313_OceanFresh_Sun_Screen_60_gm_PNG.png',300.00,275.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\nWash your face & neck with Face Wash and pat dry. Apply thin layer of Ocean Fresh Sunscreen on exposed areas like face neck and hand.\r\nRepeat after 4 hrs.','Everybody enjoys outing in sunny breezy days. But forget that harsh effects of harmful UV rays exposed to our skin and subsequent damage\r\ncaused due to this. Now forget you worries of tanning in sun or harmful effect of sunrays on your skin as Ocean Fresh presents unique sunscreen\r\nwith SPF 60 benefit to address the side effects of tropical temperature.','Oceanfresh'),(102,'Ocean fresh Shaving Cream 100gm','OCEAN FRESH SHAVING CREAM','products/PRD_10_2632022141111_Shaving_Cream_100_Gm_-_800x800.png',150.00,120.00,10,1,2,'null','OCEAN FRESH SHAVING CREAM\r\n\r\nOcean Fresh Shaving Cream is acts as a lubricant between the razor and the skin.\r\n\r\nOcean Fresh Shaving Cream moisturizes and nourishes the skin.\r\n\r\nThis shaving cream, creates a rich creamy lather that lifts your hair from the base, helping prevent acne and skin inflammation making it the\r\nperfect shaving cream for men with sensitive skin.\r\n\r\nThis can also prevent skin irritation. This shaving cream also provides hydration to the skin and follicles for the perfect glide.','Oceanfresh'),(103,'Ocean Fresh -Nourishing Shampoo - 500ml V1','Presenting Ocean Fresh Nourishing Shampoo Fortified With Dead Sea Minerals, Soya\r\nProtein And Keratin Which Revitalizes Your Hair Providing Lustrous, Shiny Hair Which\r\nYou Can Proudly Flaunt.','products/PRD_10_3142024155150_OceanFresh_Nourishing_Shampoo_500_ml_1000x1000px.png',500.00,400.00,10,1,2,'null','Every one desires to flaunt beautiful, untangling hair as it is part of one\'s personality which gives immense confidence. But due to excess\r\npollution, junk food and lack of nutrition, problems like dry hair, split hairs and hairfall are on rise. Presenting Oceanfresh Nourishing Shampoo\r\nfortified with Dead Sea Minerals, Soya Protein and Keratin which revitalizes your hair providing lustrous, shiny hair which you can proudly flaunt.','Oceanfresh'),(104,'Ocean Fresh Face Toner 100 ml','Ocean Fresh Face Toner','products/PRDPRDPRDPRDPRD_1010101010_83202216532_Face_Toner_800x800.png',300.00,250.00,10,1,2,'null','Ocean fresh face toner adds a layer of protection. it helps close pores and tighten cell gaps after cleansing due to its astringent property,\r\nreducing the penetration of impurities and environmental contaminants into the skin. It can even protect skin against harmful chemcials and\r\npollutants. It can be also used as adjuvants in dry face packs and for make-up removing. It also acts as mositurizer and skin rejuvenator.','Oceanfresh'),(105,'Ocean Fresh Face Wash For Oily Skin 100 ml','A Common Benefit Of Ocean Fresh Face Wash Is The Removal Of Dirt, Oil, And Other\r\nUnwanted Debris. Throughout The Day The Skin On Your Face Is Continually Covered\r\nWith Bacteria, Pollutants, Viruses, Dirt, And Old (Dead) Skin Cells. Daily Face Wash\r\nRemoves These Impurities To Give The Skin A Fresh Look.','products/PRD_1_2411202115422_O_Fresh_Face_Wash_For_Oily_Skin_100_ml.png',200.00,160.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\n1. Splash your face and neck with water.\r\n2. Apply face wash and massage and circular motion.\r\n3. Rinse thoroughly and pat dry.\r\n4. Suitable for all skin types.','A common benefit of Ocean Fresh Face Wash is the removal of dirt, oil, and other unwanted debris. Throughout the day the skin on your face is\r\ncontinually covered with bacteria, pollutants, viruses, dirt, and old (dead) skin cells. Daily face wash removes these impurities to give the skin a\r\nfresh look.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\nDead Sea Minerals:\r\nDead Sea minerals are known to cure skin disorders through strengthening the skin tissues, maintaining the chemical balance of the skin,\r\nstimulating blood circulation and eliminating toxins from the skin. Minerals provide protection and strengthen cell membranes against\r\ndehydration and environmental hazards.\r\n\r\nMultani Sand\r\n\r\nMultani Mitti is a natural cleanser. It\'s deep-cleansing action unclogs pores, lifts excess oil and impurities and purifies the skin, leaving it clean,\r\nfresh and porcelain textured. Due to its healing and soothing properties, it helps control excess oil production in the skin, helps in and pimples.\r\nMultani Mitti is very cooling in nature and is therefore used to treat open pores, sun burns, rashes and inflamed skin.\r\n\r\nJuniper Berry\r\n\r\nDetoxifying and full of antioxidants, Juniper Berry is a natural healer. It works to repair and strengthen the epidermis, allowing it to defend itself\r\nfrom impurities that can damage the skin and cause premature ageing.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\n1. Helps to remove dust, oil and pollution from your skin.\r\n2. Gives soft, supple and glowing skin.\r\n3. Protects skin cell from harsh chemicals.','Oceanfresh'),(106,'Ocean Fresh Hair Cream 100gm','Ocean Fresh Hair Cream 100gm','products/PRD_10_832022154327_Hair_Cream_100gm_1000x1000.png',400.00,360.00,10,1,2,'null','Ocean Fresh Hair Cream has all the nourishment of oil without the stickiness. With the benefits of Dead sea minerals, Wheatgerm, Olive and\r\nBiotin this hair cream is a replacement of oil and can be used all day, without having to worry about oil sticky look.\r\n\r\nOcean fresh hair cream nourishes your hair, adds shine , and makes them look stylish if you want frizz-free, smooth, and shining hair.','Oceanfresh'),(107,'Ocean Fresh Hair Removal Cream 50gm','Ocean Fresh Hair Removal Cream 50gm','products/PRD_10_2632022141628_Hair_Removal_Cream_50_Gm_-_800x800.png',200.00,160.00,10,1,2,'null','OCEAN FRESH HAIR REMOVAL CREAM\r\n\r\nOcean Fresh Hair Removal Cream works close to the root of your hair, giving you silky and smooth skin in just 3-6 minutes.\r\n\r\nYou can use the Hair Removal Cream over stubborn hair on all over your legs, arms, underarms, bikini as well as body hair where razors cannot\r\nreach.\r\n\r\nOcean Fresh advanced formula gives you a painless hair removal experience. so leave the razor and enjoy the smooth and soft moisturized skin in\r\nfew minutes.','Oceanfresh'),(108,'Ocean Fresh Face Scrub 100 gm','Ocean Fresh Face Scrub Work By Gently Exfoliating Dead Skin Cells From The Skin,\r\nReducing The Potential For Clogged Pores And Acne Breakouts. Also Gives You A\r\nBrighter, More Even Complexion.','products/PRD_1_241120211579_OCEAN_FRESH_FACE_SCRUB_100_GM.png',200.00,180.00,10,1,2,'null','Ocean Fresh Face Scrub work by gently exfoliating dead skin cells from the skin, reducing the potential for clogged pores and acne breakouts.\r\nAlso gives you a brighter, more even complexion.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\nDead Sea Minerals:\r\n\r\nDead Sea salt has wonderful antifungal, antimicrobial, and antibacterial properties that help cleanse and detoxify the pores by driving out oils,\r\ndirt and other impurities. This helps to eliminate acne, pimples, blackheads and whiteheads.\r\n\r\nDead Sea salt is an amazing hydrator of dry skin & great exfoliator.\r\n\r\nBlue Tansy Oil:\r\n\r\nIt\'s got antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties. Its most common use is to calm irritated skin, reduce heat, and relieve delicate or troubled\r\nskin. Blue tansy\'s ability to clear congested pores, kill off pimple-causing bacteria, and reduce redness, make it one of the best oils for acne-\r\nprone skin.\r\n\r\nGojiberry:\r\n\r\nGojiberry has skin care benefits such as antioxidant and anti-aging protection, as well as improved skin tone coloration.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS:\r\n\r\n1. Helps remove dead skin & unclog skin pores.\r\n2. Protects against environmental damage and UV rays.\r\n3. Evens out skin tone and reduce hyperpigmentation.\r\n\r\nUSE INSTRUCTIONS:\r\n\r\no Step 1 : Apply an adequate amount of Ocean Fresh Face Scrub on wet face & neck.\r\no Step 2 : Massage gently with your fingertips in an upward circular motion.\r\nStep 3 : Concentrate scrubbing your forehead, nose & chin.\r\no Step 4 : Rinse off with water and pat dry.\r\no Step 5 : Use at least twice a week for best results.','Oceanfresh'),(109,'Ocean Fresh Face Pack 100gm','Ocean Fresh Face Pack','products/PRD_10_832022155840_Face_Pack_100GM_1000x1000.png',300.00,250.00,10,1,2,'null','Oceanfresh face pack is effective in reducing the size of enlarged pores, It helps in deep cleansing the skin thereby preventing acne caused by\r\ndirt, oil, and chemicals getting accumulated inside the enlarged pores.\r\n\r\nIt helps to hydrates, plumps, and brightens parched skin with antioxidant-rich extracts, cucumber helps in moisturisation, while almond oil n rose\r\nbrightens the skin, anti-oxidants reverse the signs of ageing, keeps face hydrated and smooth. Suitable for all skin types, this\r\n\r\npack targets dullness and uneven skin tone for a brighter looking ,glowing skin.','Oceanfresh'),(110,'Ocean Fresh D-Tan Facial Kit - 260 Gm.','Ocean Fresh D-Tan Facial Kit - 260 Gm.','products/PRD_10_1472022161427_De-Tan_Facial_Kit_-_1000x1000.png',1300.00,1200.00,10,1,2,'null','Ocean Fresh D-Tan Facial Kit Specially created for an instant dose of tan removal & brightness for tanned and dull skin.\r\n\r\nIt is very effective for instant glow on normal to oily skin types.\r\n\r\nBlended with dead sea minerals\r\n\r\nWhich will promote collagen production, fight free radical, reduce the appearance of darkness, sun induced damage & reduce the appearance of\r\ndune tensions & blemishes','Oceanfresh'),(111,'Ocean Fresh Cool Cool Oil 100ml','Ocean Fresh Cool Cool Oil 100ml','products/PRD_10_832022155431_Cool_Cool_Oil_100ml_1000x1000.png',200.00,175.00,10,1,2,'null','Ocean fresh cool cool hair oil is a premium blend of natural herbs with unique cooling properties to calm and relax your mind, relieves stress\r\nwhile nourishing the scalp and strengthening the hair follicles. It relieves mild headache tension,and induces sound sleep. Ocean fresh Cool Cool\r\nHair Oil contains the precious blend of unique herbs -dead sea minerals,camphor,sesame oil, Amla, Bhringraj, with cooling effect of Menthol and\r\nKapoor.','Oceanfresh'),(112,'Ocean Fresh BB Cream 20gm','Ocean Fresh BB Cream Is A Clever Little Product Which Provides Benefits Of Primer,\r\nMoisturizer, Foundation, Concealer And Sunblock In One.','products/PRD_10_211202515023_BB_Cream_1000x1000.png',200.00,175.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\no Apply the BB cream like your regular moisturizer. Use light circular strokes starting from the middle of your face outwards on perfectly\r\ncleansed skin. Use after ocean fresh face wash','\"Imperfection\" is not a word for skin tone any more. Ocean fresh BB cream is a clever little product which provides benefits of primer, moisturizer,\r\nfoundation, concealer and sunblock in one. Treat your skin with this powerful multi-tasker that corrects, hydrates, repairs and protects your skin\r\nfrom sun damage, leaving it feeling healthy and fresh.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\no DEAD SEA MINERALS: Imparts minerals like magnesium which regulates skin regeneration and repair. Minerals also improves elasticity,\r\nskin tone and reduces signs of ageing.\r\no PEACH: Peach is a rich source of vitamins, minerals and antioxidants. It moisturizes dry skin and gets you rid of dry, rough or flaky skin\r\npatches. It hydrates skin and makes it plump and supple again. Peach helps repair and regenerate skin tissue and protects the skin against\r\nexternal influences. It has ability to tighten the skin and reduce wrinkles and fine lines.\r\no SAFFRON: When it comes to the skin, saffron is one of the best brightening agent. Saffron provides instant glow on skin along with radiant\r\nand lustrous look. It also works against hyperpigmentation, inflammation and soothes skin.\r\no VITAMIN-E: Being a strong antioxidant, it protects skin from sunburn, sun damage, skin cancers, and aging changes like roughness,\r\ndehydration, wrinkling, and age spots. It reduces melanin pigment production as well and helps to improve uneven skin tone and tanning.\r\nThe versatile nature of Vitamin E improves dark circles at all levels owing to its antioxidant action.\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\no Oceanfresh BB cream works like light makeup which gives you instant glow and radiant skin.\r\no Cover blemishes and imperfections on skin without irritation.','Oceanfresh'),(113,'Ocean Fresh BB Cream 20gm V2','Ocean Fresh BB Cream Is A Clever Little Product Which Provides Benefits Of Primer,\r\nMoisturizer, Foundation, Concealer And Sunblock In One.','products/PRD_1_21202217307_BB_Cream_3D.png',250.00,200.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\nApply the BB cream like your regular moisturizer. Use light circular strokes starting from the middle of your face outwards on perfectly cleansed\r\nskin. Use after ocean fresh face wash','\"Imperfection\" is not a word for skin tone any more. Ocean fresh BB cream is a clever little product which provides benefits of primer, moisturizer,\r\nfoundation, concealer and sunblock in one. Treat your skin with this powerful multi-tasker that corrects, hydrates, repairs and protects your skin\r\nfrom sun damage, leaving it feeling healthy and fresh.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\nDEAD SEA MINERALS: Imparts minerals like magnesium which regulates skin regeneration and repair. Minerals also improves elasticity, skin\r\ntone and reduces signs of ageing.\r\n\r\nPEACH: Peach is a rich source of vitamins, minerals and antioxidants. It moisturizes dry skin and gets you rid of dry, rough or flaky skin patches. It\r\nhydrates skin and makes it plump and supple again. Peach helps repair and regenerate skin tissue 