kin.','products/PRD_10_1612022115337_Charcoal_Face_Wash_3D.png',200.00,180.00,10,1,2,'null','INGREDIENTS\r\n\r\nACTIVATED CHARCOAL: It has high negative charge due to which is attracts positively charged toxins, bacteria, viruses, dirt etc. It helps to\r\nremove these from dead skin cells in individuals who have hard skin.\r\n\r\nMULBERRY: Loaded with vitamins like A, E & C mulberry helps to lightens dark spots and skin discolouration. It moisturizes & nourishes\r\nthe skin. Anthocyanin antioxidant reduces signs of premature ageing.\r\n\r\nSEA BUCKTHORN: Sea buckthorn oil may help your skin heal from wounds, sunburns. Antioxidants present in seabuckthorn oil reduces\r\neffect of free radicles on skin & signs of ageing.\r\n\r\nAPPLE: It helps to improves your complexion by lightning blemishes and dark spots. Also works as natural toner and moisturizer and\r\nhydrates skin to provide soft & supple skin tone. It also helps in production of elastin and collagen and provides elasticity to skin.\r\n\r\nVETIVER: It astringent action tightens skin pores and balances skin Ph. It helps to reduce skin oiliness, and thereby helps to reduce acne\r\ninfection as well.\r\n\r\nLIQUORICE: It helps to Soothes and Hydrate Skin, helping from irritation caused due to excessive sweating. It also helps to fade dark\r\nhyperpigmentation spots on skin.\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\nActivated Charcoal Face Wash eliminate impurities & damage caused due to pollution giving a clearer & even skin tone.\r\n\r\nIt is infused with Charcoal powder that is proven to absorb multiple times its own mass in harmful substances like toxins, impurities,\r\nbacteria, dirt and helps fight acne.\r\n\r\nThis face wash is specially designed to work for tough skin.\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\nUSE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\nMoisten face and neck. Apply a small amount of Face wash and massage gently using a circular motion\r\n\r\nWorking up a fine lather & Wash off and pat dry.','Oceanfresh'),(116,'Ocean Fresh Anti Septic Cream 60gm','Ocean Fresh Antiseptic Cream','products/PRDPRDPRDPRDPRDPRD_101010101010_83202216620_Anti_Septic_Cream_60g_800x800.png',200.00,180.00,10,1,2,'null','oceanfresh antiseptic cream is a preventive, curative and healing ointment which soothes and heals wounds, protects against infection and can\r\nbe used to treat cuts and grazes, minor burns and scalds, small areas of sunburn, dry chapped skin, nappy rash, insect bites, spots and pimples.','Oceanfresh'),(117,'Ocean Fresh Anti - Pimple Cream 60gm','Ocean Fresh Anti Pimple Cream','products/PRDPRDPRDPRDPRDPRDPRD_10101010101010_83202216654_Anti_Pimple_Cream_60g_800x800.png',200.00,180.00,10,1,2,'null','Ocean fresh Anti-Pimple Cream is a perfect cure for all possible skin conditions including acne, pimples, and skin eruptions. With dead sea\r\nminerals,alovera this cream blended with Tea tree oil and Clove oil, rosemary oil all being major anti-inflammatory, anti-bacterial and anti-septic\r\nagents. Also, this cream is the most natural cleanser and purifier and helps to remove dark spots due to acne.','Oceanfresh'),(118,'Myristika Pain Relief Gel','Myristika Pain Gel Is An Amazing Combination Of Essential Oils, Botanicals Which\r\nRelieves Sore Muscles & Pain Associated With Bone & Joint Problems.','products/PRD_1_412022161015_Pain_Gel.png',300.00,250.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\no Apply on affected areas and rub in circular motion for 5-10 minutes till the gel gets completely absorbed in the skin.','Every day wear and tear of bone and joints along with muscle spasm require natural therapy to relive it not heavy dose of chemical pain killers.\r\nMyristika Pain Gel is an amazing combination of essential oils, botanicals which relieves sore muscles & pain associated with bone & joint\r\nproblems.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\no Methol & Wintergreen Oil\r\nHas natural analgesic property. It reduces swelling and pain associated with joint.\r\n\r\no Thymol & Peppermint Oil\r\nVery good in reliving sore muscles & spasm.\r\n\r