Robusta\r\nVery unique herb which helps to heal cracked heels\r\n\r\no Salicylic & Glycolic Acid\r\nDue to its scrapping effect helps to remove dead skin and hyper pigmented skin from foot.\r\n\r\no White Curcumin\r\nIt is loaded with- skin lightening, anti-bacterial, anti-viral, anti-inflammatory, antioxidant and\r\n\r\nantiseptic properties. Due to all these properties it helps in heeling cracked heals.\r\n\r\no Tea Tree Oil\r\nKnown natural cleanser that removes dirt and impurities, it balances oily skin and has refreshing scent that kills bad odour.\r\n\r\nIt improves blood circulation, prevent infection, kill germs and reduces pain\r\n\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\no It moisturizes and protect your foot or sole skin.\r\no It is very helpful in repairing and preventing cracked heels.\r\no It relieves you from pain caused by cracked heels or by ill-fitting foot wares.\r\no It helps in preventing hyperkeratosis (thickening of foot skin) & hyperpigmentation (Blackening) syndrome.\r\no It has calming and relaxing effects on skin.','Myristika'),(120,'Ocean Fresh Day Cream 60gm','Ocean Fresh - Day Cream Helps To Restore Radiance By Hydrating And Moisturizing\r\nSkin. It Provides Bright Skin With Even Skin Tone And Light Feel Whole Day So That\r\nYou Can Just Keep Blushing','products/PRD_1_212022172855_OceanFresh_Day_Cream_3D.png',200.00,150.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTION:\r\n\r\nSplash your face and neck with water.\r\no Apply face wash and massage in circular motion.\r\nRinse thoroughly and pat dry.\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','Are you worried about dry, dull, lustreless skin tone along with signs of ageing. Keep all your worries at bay as Ocean fresh - Day Cream helps\r\nto restore radiance by hydrating and moisturizing skin. It provides bright skin with even skin tone and light feel whole day so that you can just\r\nkeep blushing.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\no ALMOND OIL: It also helps to eradicate skin blemishes and diminish age lines. It has essential fatty acids and vitamin E which supports\r\nskin sebum layer and supports skin structure.\r\no ALOVERA: It supports skin hydration and helps in restoring skin\'s lipid barrier so that skin lookd soft and supple. It has anti-microbial\r\nproperties as well and soothes skin.\r\no DEAD SEA MINERALS: Helps fight off pro-ageing free radicals: Minerals in the Dead Sea Salt fight of oxidation in the skin cells by\r\neliminating free radicals, helping your skin look younger and more vibrant.\r\nBENEFITS:\r\n\r\nOcean fresh day cream is designed to primarily protect and support your skin during the day against damaging UV rays, pollution and\r\nenvironmental stress.\r\n\r\nIt softens the skin, evens skin tone and improves texture.\r\n\r\nIt provides radiance along with skin firming benefits','Oceanfresh'),(121,'Ocean Fresh Face Wash For Normal & Dry Skin 100 ml','Clear, Bright & Beautiful Skin Is A Dream Of Everyone. Ocean Fresh Face Wash An\r\nEffective Formulation Helps In Removing Dirt, Sweat, Excess Oil And Makeup Very\r\nThoroughly. It Helps Recover A Clear, Radiant And Even Complexion. So That Your Skin\r\nLooks Fabulously Clean, Smooth And Glowing.','products/PRD_1_2411202115611_O_FRESH_FACE_WASH_FOR_NORMAL__DRY_SKIN_100_ML.png',200.00,160.00,10,1,2,'USE INSTRUCTIONS\r\n\r\n1. Splash your face and neck with water.\r\n2. Apply face wash and massage and circular motion.\r\n3. Rinse thoroughly and pat dry.\r\n4. Suitable for all skin types.','Clear, bright & beautiful skin is a dream of everyone. Ocean Fresh Face Wash an effective formulation helps in removing dirt, sweat, excess oil\r\nand makeup very thoroughly. It helps recover a clear, radiant and even complexion. So that your skin looks fabulously clean, smooth and\r\nglowing.\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS\r\n\r\nDead Sea Minerals:\r\n\r\nThese salts are said to heal acne, scars and skin allergies. It also helps in keeping the skin hydrated and minimize pores. Dead Sea minerals are\r\nknown to cure skin disorders through strengthening the skin tissues, maintaining the chemical balance of the skin, stimulating blood circulation\r\nand eliminating toxins from the skin.\r\nCranberry:\r\n\r\nIts high acid content aids in collagen production which in turn makes the skin look soft, radiant and glowing. Cranberry also has anti-ageing\r\nproperties and can prevent the occurrence of wrinkles on the skin, thus making your face and skin look fresh and youthful.\r\n\r\nVitamins present in cranberries also lighten your skin tone makes your skin even toned and radiant.\r\n\r\nCalendula:\r\n\r\nIt has astringent properties which lighten your skin tone & makes it radiant. Calendula oil has antifungal, anti-inflammatory, and antibacterial\r\nproperties that might make it useful in healing wounds, soothing eczema.\r\n\r\nIt\'s property helps for keeps your skin healthy. It can firm your skin.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\n1. Helps to remove dust, oil and pollution from your skin.\r\n2. Gives soft, supple and glowing skin.\r\n3. Protects skin cell from harsh chemicals.','Oceanfresh'),(122,'Myristika Herbal Toothpaste','One Of Its Kind Revolutionary Toothpaste Provides Benefits Like Freedom Form Plaque,\r\nTartar, Cavities, Bad Breath And Provides Strong White Teeth.','products/PRDPRD_11_2422025181439_Tp1.png',200.00,150.00,10,1,2,'Use Instructions:\r\n\r\nSuggested use: To be used in morning and before bed time with good toothbrush for effective results.','Coral Calcium :-\r\n\r\n1. Only toothpaste to have natural source of Calcium. Our tooth enamel is made of Calcium and requires calcium for its wear and\r\ntear. Myristika Herbal Toothpaste provides most bioactive source of calcium which is easily absorbed and fortifies your dental enamel.\r\nArginine :-\r\n\r\n2. Arginine is clinically proven in reducing caries and treating dentinal sensitivity.\r\n3. Arginine have been proven to plug and seal open dentinal tubules.\r\nWhite Curcumin\r\n\r\n1. Curcumin, a compound obtained from this rhizome, shows painkiller activity better than aspirin. (Anti-inflammatory and painkiller property)\r\n2. Curcumin shows the highest anti-allergen activity and this is mediated by inhibiting activity of inflammatory proteins and preventing\r\nrelease of chemicals that initiate allergic reactions.\r\n3. Also works as anti-cancerous and protects from dangers from tobacco, gutka chewing.\r\nBromelain\r\n\r\n1. Bromelain prevents plaque formation and restricts the activity of bacteria in mouth by lowering the chances of periodontal diseases and\r\ngingivitis.\r\n2. This specially plant based enzyme works and bleaching agent and helps to remove stains of tea and coffee from teeths.\r\nIRIMEDADAI TAILAM\r\n\r\n1. One of its kind Ancient Ayurevdic Classical formulation to treat all types of oral problems from rootcause.\r\n2. It helps to relieve tooth decay, removes stains.It relieves bad breath problem.\r\nBenefits:\r\n\r\n1. Helps to fight against dental problems like plaque, tartar, tooth decay.\r\n2. Helps in Pyorrhea, Swelling & bleeding gums.\r\n3. Protects enamel from erosion due to natural calcium\r\n4. Natural whitening of teeth due to plant enzyme bleaching effect.\r\n5. Relieves teeth sensitivity.','Myristika');
